      "title": "MSHTA spawning PowerShell",
      "content": "Scenario MSHTA spawning PowerShell. Description: Reviewable MSHTA-PowerShell scenario in which cmd.exe launches mshta.exe and mshta.exe launches powershell.exe with -noexit -command Get-Service sysmon. Process creation records establish the launch command, not successful cmdlet completion or a finalized attack determination. Analysis status: draft_reviewable. Observed behavior: PowerShell was launched with -noexit -command Get-Service sysmon. cmd.exe launched mshta.exe with an inline vbscript:Execute command. mshta.exe launched PowerShell.",
